OL,3,GNEWSAA united Ireland would be
OL,4,A'fantastic' says Trump during Irish
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,8,Fwould love to see a united Ireland
OL,9,Fwhile at a meeting with the Taoiseach
OL,10,F(Irish Prime Minister) during a visit
OL,11,Fin Dublin.
OL,13,FTrump is on a two-day visit to the
OL,14,Fcountry where earlier he had a courtesy
OL,15,Fcall with the Irish President Catherine
OL,16,FConnolly at the Aras an Uachtarain -
OL,17,Fthe official residence of the Irish
OL,18,Fpresident.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
