OL,3,GNEWSAA united Ireland would be
OL,4,A'fantastic' says Trump during Irish
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe has been attending meetings in
OL,8,FDublin, before travelling to the Amgen
OL,9,FIrish Open golf tournament later on
OL,10,FSaturday.
OL,12,FTrump said a united Ireland would
OL,13,Fhappen eventually and that the
OL,14,FTaoiseach was "the right man over here
OL,15,Fto get it moving".
